  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot combine dried barley and water; bring to a boil and simmer for 18 minutes until barley is tender.",
    "Add diced onion, minced garlic, cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper; continue simmering for 8 minutes until aromatics soften.",
    "Stir in lemon zest and lemon juice; simmer for 4 minutes to meld flavors.",
    "Remove pot from heat and fold in plain yogurt gradually to avoid curdling; stir until soup is creamy.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning with additional salt or lemon juice if needed.",
    "Ladle soup into bowls and serve hot, optionally garnished with a drizzle of olive oil or fresh herbs."
